Seems like this bug runs down to [this line](https://github.com/swc-project/swc/blob/2211a9908a9a1c2e01d5f483ad91ac396336dc08/ecmascript/transforms/base/src/fixer.rs#L667). What is the purpose of this line @kdy1? There are many cases where I believe it would cause bug, e.g.
```js
const a = {
   foo() {
    console.log(this.name)
   }
};

(0, a.foo)()
```
or 
```js
window.__defineGetter__('a', () => {
  console.log(1);
  return 2;
})

let b = (a, 123)
```
